// #256 regression fixture: device math builtins must be REJECTED, not emitted as
// unresolved `.extern .func` calls. This file is deliberately NOT in the
// successful-emit list in .github/workflows/gpu-kernel.yml; that job asserts it
// fails with a location-bearing diagnostic and writes no PTX.
k(x<Float>)<Float> -> { return exp(x) + sin(x) + cos(x) + tan(x) + log(x) }
